     .btn/.btn-ghost component (global.css:15,18-19); nothing is added to global.css.
     .share-status copies .nl-status's :empty-hides behaviour (global.css:561-562) without
     the newsletter's [data-tone] colours (563-564), which are tuned for the white .news
     band rather than this dark panel — both sit on .homeroom's `color:#fff`. */
  #give .give-share{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px 18px;margin-top:30px;max-width:var(--give-measure)}
  #give .give-share .fine{flex:1 1 100%}
